__Purpose__

This document provides the QTI&trade; Multimedia Framework (QMMF) software development kit (SDK) user guide and API reference guide.

__Capabilities__

The QTI&trade; Multimedia Framework (QMMF) SDK
abstracts the low-level interface with camera, video, audio, and display and provides a higher, usecase-level
interface for IOT application developers


